# `list[i & 7] ?? 100` in a loop over a list of fractions that may have holes. The read gives `undefined` for a hole and past the end, on rare edges. An element that
# is no hole equals itself, so it is not the NaN that stands for `undefined` either: the way from the read goes past that test, and the loop looks at the bits of no number.
